## Model card

- **Name:** Grok 5
- **Short description:** xAI's next-generation flagship model announced as in training. As of September/October 2026, Grok 5 has not been released publicly. xAI has shipped Grok 4.7 on 2026-09-21 as the current flagship.
- **Provider / access:** xAI / SpaceXAI. No public API or model ID.
- **Release / knowledge:** Not released as of 2026-11-04. Training reported in Jan 2026 Series E announcement; no official release date or model card.
- **IDs:** grok-5 (unreleased)
- **Context window:** Not officially confirmed. Estimates of 1.5M tokens circulate but are not confirmed.
- **Modalities:** Expected multimodal, but not confirmed.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-04):** Not published.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary; parameter count estimates of 6T circulate but are unconfirmed.

